      <div type="clause" n="17.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 17.2</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="xno" source="#robertson" n="17.2" corresp="#wit-i">[Ki retient le dener Seint Pere, le dener rendra per la justice de seinte eglise e XXX den. forfait.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-i">[He who withholds Peter's Pence shall pay the penny through the court of Holy Church, and 30 pence as a fine.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="505">ECf 10.2</note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">vgl. ebd. 10, 2</note>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 262–263 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added; 17.2 and 17.3 are from I (not in Hk) (Robertson).</note>
      </div>
